:::

::: {.column width="50%"}

::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(casen_proc,
       aes(x = tramo_ingreso, fill = sexo)) +
  geom_bar(position = "fill") +
  scale_y_continuous(labels = scales::label_percent()) +
  labs(x = "Tramo de ingreso",
       y = "Porcentaje", fill = "Sexo")
```

